{"html": "<p>If you’re looking for a new laptop or a gift for the student in your life, you can save $50 on the <strong>MacBook Neo</strong> at several retailers, in both storage sizes and all four colors. The 256GB model is currently discounted to $649 (<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GR6KJ72L?tag=theverge02-20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Amazon</a>, <a href=\"https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fapple-macbook-neo-13-inch-laptop-a18-pro-chip-with-6core-cpu-and-5core-gpu-8gb-memory-256gb-ssd-blush%2FJJGCQYXQ58\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Best Buy</a>, <a href=\"https://goto.target.com/c/482924/81938/2092?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.target.com%2Fp%2Fapple-macbook-neo-a18-pro-2026-laptop%2F-%2FA-95288385\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Target</a>), while the 512GB model with Touch ID is down to $749 (<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GR685V9X?tag=theverge02-20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Amazon</a>, <a href=\"https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fapple-macbook-neo-13-inch-laptop-a18-pro-chip-with-6core-cpu-and-5core-gpu-8gb-memory-512gb-ssd-blush%2FJJGCQYXHHC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Best Buy</a>, <a href=\"https://goto.target.com/c/482924/81938/2092?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.target.com%2Fp%2Fapple-macbook-neo-a18-pro-2026-laptop%2F-%2FA-95288385%3Fpreselect%3D91122075\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Target</a>). None of the retailers currently list an end date for the discount, which is the biggest price drop we’ve seen since <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/tech/956903/apple-price-increase-2026-macbook-ipad-mac-home-vision-pro\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Apple raised the laptop’s MSRP by $100 in July</a> in response to the <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/news/839353/pc-ram-shortage-pricing-spike-news\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ongoing RAM crisis</a>.</p>"}